POST http://localhost:3000/api/search HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
User-Agent: curl/7.64.1
Accept-Encoding: gzip
Connection: keep-alive
Host: localhost:3000

{
    "city": ["batu", "bsd", "kulon_progo", "singaraja"],
    "ratings": [3,2,4],
    "ranges": ["$$"],
    "from": 0,
    "to": 23,              // Changed to get 24 items (0-23 inclusive)
    "requestedItems": 24,   // Added to explicitly request 24 items
    "page": 1              // Added page number for clarity
}

### Test with different ranges
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "from": 0,
    "to": 23,
    "requestedItems": 24
}


